Think: Run a single awk command that processes the files listed in file_list.txt (prefixed with example_files/ in the same order), appends integer-only lines to numbers_list.txt, alphabetic-containing lines to skipped_lines.txt, and builds processing_report.txt with per-file counts and zero-int files.

Act: bash

